        "reason": "Conflicts: ir.go retains SourceLength and Generator metadata; iteration.go retains dynamic cached ordinary iterator dispatch, truthy done reads, destructuring type metadata and adds generator next/return with explicit undefined input. Generator close bypasses the zero-argument ordinary protocol adapter after ASan exposed a stack read; freshness treats accessor-capable iterator nodes conservatively as calls. counts.md seeded from ours and regenerated once. Existing regexp rows change because boxed iterator values now own reads, as measured by the source lane; every extra changed row is audited separately. Source generator and native test-split evidence moved under this branch. Focused generator Node comparisons in both backends with sanitizers, analyses and call-target readers pass; cancellation finally omission overlay caught; native artifact reuse and regexp result shape controls pass. Vet passes."
